<title>CHINA: Trade in South China Strategic suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in South China Strategic suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of South China Strategic Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The company shares gained HK$0.065 or 24.1 percent to end at HK$0.335 on Tuesday on volume of 431.5 million shares.</p>
<p>South China Strategic manufactures pharmaceuticals products. It also engages in property investment and securities trading businesses.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
